  seoTitle="Melanocortin antagonists: switching the system off"
  kicker="The off-switch"
  description="A melanocortin antagonist blocks a receptor so α-MSH or ACTH cannot activate it — the map of natural brakes, research tools, and clinical antagonists for cachexia and adrenal disease."
